    "col_intro_title": "What is this site about",
    "col_intro_text": "In this site, I'm presenting some of my current interests on what to pursue in my life. The motivation is to gain feedback, reach possible collaborators and to find funding/employment avenues. \nClick on a node in graph for description.\n\nMy interests are not limited to the ones presented here, but I hope these  give some kind of impression of me in general.",
    "details_title": "Descriptions",
    "details_hint": "Click on a topic in the graph to see details here",
    "vote_title": "Influence my focus",
    "vote_text": "What themes, projects or skills do you think I should pursue? Based on what would be important or what I would be good at, for example. \n\nYou can vote here: https://forms.gle/XR1jRv25ng2Ky5SE6\n\nI'll take your opinions into account. Form also has an open field that you can use how you wish. ",
    "funding_title": "Funding/work opportunities",
    "funding_intro": "Currently I'm pursuing these interests on my own time but I'm also looking for work/funding. Feel free to contact me with suggestions regarding work on these intererests or anything else you think I might be interested in. \n\nYou can check my CV here: https://villeseppala.wordpress.com/cv/\nYou can reach me at villemail11 (at) gmail.com\n\nHere is my current preference order for different funding sources:",
